   also to Sabine Hornung (University of Mainz), Astrid Stobbe and Tanja
   Zerl (both from University of Frankfurt/Main) for discussion of the
   archaeobotanical and archaeological backgrounds of the Eifel region.
   Finally we would like to thank John Hodgson and Catherine Longford (both
   University of Sheffield, England) for improving the English.
